uid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/thailand-built-a-400-metre-fishing-pier-13-years-later-the-shoreline-had-advanced-by-up-to-250-metres-on-one-side/articleshow/134438373.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T19:12:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134438516,imgsize-106364.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Donald Trump says Canada has too many immigrants, but the math doesn’t add up]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134442547.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Canada has recently admitted a record number of permanent residents, primarily focusing on economic immigration programs. In contrast, the US processes significantly more green cards through family-based categories than Canada does. India's immigrants play critical roles in both countries, particularly in skilled job sectors. Trump's comments regarding immigration have drawn criticism for being racially charged and factually inaccurate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-says-canada-has-too-many-immigrants-but-the-math-doesnt-add-up/articleshow/134442547.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-says-canada-has-too-many-immigrants-but-the-math-doesnt-add-up/articleshow/134442547.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T22:09:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Chidanand Rajghatta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134442665,imgsize-51006.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[She turned America’s waste paper into Chinese packaging: How Zhang Yin built her billion-dollar empire]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134442077.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Zhang Yin launched her paper-trading venture in Hong Kong in 1985 with a simple investment strategy. Spotting a lucrative market in collecting waste paper from the United States to ship to China, she founded America Chung Nam, eventually becoming the top exporter of this recyclable material. Expanding further, she created Nine Dragons Paper, seeing tremendous growth in China’s booming economy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1985-she-started-a-paper-business-with-with-3800-us-dollars-21-years-later-she-became-chinas-richest-person-how-zhang-yin-turned-americas-waste-paper-into-a-paper-empire/articleshow/134442077.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1985-she-started-a-paper-business-with-with-3800-us-dollars-21-years-later-she-became-chinas-richest-person-how-zhang-yin-turned-americas-waste-paper-into-a-paper-empire/articleshow/134442077.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T21:43:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134442088,imgsize-1186731.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Another Trump-Putin meeting soon? US invites Russian Prez to G20 summit in Dec]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134441760.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US Secretary of State Marco Rubio has confirmed that President Vladimir Putin has been invited to the upcoming G20 summit in December. Rubio emphasized that direct engagement between President Trump and world leaders could address important issues. There have been discussions on limited ceasefires in the ongoing Russia-Ukraine war, with proposals from various countries. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy has expressed readiness for negotiations regarding maritime security in the Black Sea.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/another-donald-trump-putin-meeting-soon-us-invites-russian-president-to-g20-summit-in-december/articleshow/134441760.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/another-donald-trump-putin-meeting-soon-us-invites-russian-president-to-g20-summit-in-december/articleshow/134441760.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T21:17:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134441884,imgsize-131404.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[18-year-old violinist turns concussion recovery into protocol for injured musicians, wins $25,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134415103.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-khaos-kook-the-18-year-old-washington-violinist-whose-concussion-kept-him-from-playing-for-over-six-months-he-turned-recovery-into-a-protocol-for-injured-musicians-and-won-25000/articleshow/134415103.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-khaos-kook-the-18-year-old-washington-violinist-whose-concussion-kept-him-from-playing-for-over-six-months-he-turned-recovery-into-a-protocol-for-injured-musicians-and-won-25000/articleshow/134415103.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T21:00:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134415389,imgsize-113483.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rare Mission Creek Houseboat Sale: Floating home seeks $1.749 million; sales unusually infrequent]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134434015.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Nestled in Mission Creek, San Francisco, a one-of-a-kind floating home is on the market for $1.749 million. This remarkable residence features three bedrooms, three bathrooms, and encompasses 1,980 square feet. Once a modest boat, it has been extensively renovated into this luxurious habitat. With only 20 floating homes in the community, its rarity adds to its allure, especially with proximity to sports venues and tech hubs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-san-francisco-houseboat-just-minutes-from-openais-headquarters-has-been-listed-for-1-749-million-the-floating-home-is-one-of-only-about-20-residences-in-the-mission-creek-community/articleshow/134434015.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-san-francisco-houseboat-just-minutes-from-openais-headquarters-has-been-listed-for-1-749-million-the-floating-home-is-one-of-only-about-20-residences-in-the-mission-creek-community/articleshow/134434015.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T21:00:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134434279,imgsize-1216805.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Georgia estate with military camp roots asks $7.5M after 30 years as a retreat now]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134410809.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-georgia-property-began-as-a-military-academy-summer-camp-after-30-years-as-one-familys-retreat-the-280-acre-estate-with-a-10-acre-lake-and-six-miles-of-trails-is-asking-7-5-million/articleshow/134410809.cms]]></link><guid><![CDAT